    "chunk_text": "feldes & medwe XXV \u00e6cera & wi\u00f0utan \u00fean ige sixti sticca \u00deer wi\u00f0utan & him man sealde wi\u00f0 Oxanige & wi\u00f0 \u00f0an \u00feer utan XXV mancussa goldes. & him weron festermen Gyreweard & \u00e6thelno\u00f0 \u00e6t\u00feelfer\u00f0es sune greatan & Wulno\u00f0es agen sune. \u00deonne is geseald wi\u00f0 Wy\u00f0eringaige & Oxanige XV pund. \u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00feere \u00fereore hyda \u00e6t \u00feeorp \u00fee Adeluuold biscop gebohte \u00e6t Sygefer\u00f0e mid XVI \u00deet is \u00feonne \u00e6rest Frena & \u00e6lsige & \u00e6lfno\u00f0 Badan sune & Osfer\u00f0 Fri\u00f0egistes sune & Hudeman & \u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Herulf Adan sune funde Aldulfe abbod & Goduine \u00e6lfsies sune \u00fea hi \u00feat \u00deas is \u00e6thestan Catlan sune & Leofsie \u00feurlaces sune & Tufes on Hylpestune & \u00e6\u00f0estan on Uptune & & \u00feis wes gedon \u00e6t Vndelum on \u00feere VIII hundreda gewytnesse. \u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee \u00e6incund funde \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t \u00fean lande \u00e6t Anlafestune \u00fee he \u00e6t him \u00deet is Eadric on Torp & E\u00f0estan Catlan sune & Tufes on Beornican & Tufes on Hylpestune & Leofsie \u00deis synd \u00fea borhhanda \u00fee Swuste & hire dohter funden \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t o\u00f0re \u00e6lfe hyde \u00e6t \u00deet wes Goduine \u00e6lfsies sune & \u00e6lfno\u00f0 \u00e6t Creast & Sumerlyda preost & Sumerlyda \u00e6t Stoce & Osulf \u00deis synd \u00fea Wynemannes lafe \u00e6t",
